Package: com.zeshan.phoneaura
Name: PhoneAura
Version: 0.4.15
Architecture: iphoneos-arm64
Description: PhoneAura is a free, modern redesign of the iOS 16 Phone app. Version 0.4.15 adds a native long-press editing menu wherever a phone number is displayed. Editable keypad numbers support Cut, Copy and Paste; read-only contact, recent-call and detail numbers support safe Copy and Paste to Keypad without changing saved contact data. It also preserves the fixed saved-number suggestion area, Number not saved status, corrected Next Solution header logo, original Number Options menu, custom Favorites, smart Recents filters, Contacts, haptics and animations. Built for rootless jailbreaks.
Depiction: https://zeshan0727.github.io/depictions/phoneaura.html
Homepage: https://zeshan0727.github.io/
Maintainer: Next Solution
Author: Next Solution
Section: Tweaks
Depends: firmware (>= 16.0), mobilesubstrate, preferenceloader
